Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:56:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] 3D Dodge: a small game on the DS 3D engine (Start > Games), a
 3x3 tunnel with walls of blocks and a guaranteed free path, speed rising with
 each wave, best score kept in /home/dodge.best

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
